ered out of focus to emphasize the main subject. The road area behind her includes cars, headlights, and traffic signals, with one red signal visible near the middle distance. The lighting is natural daylight, likely late afternoon or early evening, with warm highlights on the subject’s face and cool shadows in the street. The image has cinematic color grading, crisp detail on the woman, creamy background blur, and a dynamic city atmosphere created by motion streaks, glowing signs, and pedestrian movement. The overall style is contemporary lifestyle fashion photography with realistic textures, soft contrast, and a bustling metropolitan mood."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 683, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 472, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [681], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [436.42803955078125, 106], "pos": [-307.58197021484375, 2236.065185546875], "widgets_values": ["qwen3.5_9b_qwen_image_2.1_pe_t2i.int8_convrot.safetensors", "qwen_image", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {}, "id": 471, "type": "CLIPLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"clip_name": true, "type": true, "device": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [703], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [510, 90], "pos": [1276.913818359375, 2111.709716796875], "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "un